cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the immutable public release or commit you use, and the upstream paper and code listed in UPSTREAM.md."
title: "Planning on 15x15 mazes: an independent STA and max-sum benchmark"
version: 0.1.0
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "STA planning benchmark contributors"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible noiseless planning benchmark on 20 mazes and 3000 start-goal
  pairs. STA uses its specified finite inputs and marginal decoding; max-sum
  uses hard constraints and backtracing. This release does not isolate the
  update rule under identical factors and decoding.
